## Competitor Landscape

Competitor: Illuvium
Category: Blockchain Gaming (AAA RPG, Open World, Autobattler)
Difference: Illuvium fokus AAA 3D RPG/autobattler di Immutable X (L2 Ethereum), tidak memiliki appchain sendiri; Axie Infinity turn-based strategy 2D/2.5D dengan appchain Ronin mandiri (HIGH) [Illuvium Website, https://illuvium.io/; Messari Illuvium, https://messari.io/asset/illuvium/profile; Immutable X, https://www.immutable.com/]
Market Segment: Blockchain Gaming / NFT Gaming / Play-to-Earn
Sources: https://illuvium.io/; https://messari.io/asset/illuvium/profile; https://www.immutable.com/

Competitor: The Sandbox
Category: Blockchain Gaming / Metaverse (Voxel, UGC, Land)
Difference: The Sandbox fokus UGC (user-generated content) voxel metaverse di Ethereum/Polygon, tidak memiliki appchain gaming dedikasi; Axie Infinity fokus game loop PvP/PvE + breeding + land sim di Ronin appchain (HIGH) [The Sandbox Website, https://www.sandbox.game/; Messari Sandbox, https://messari.io/asset/the-sandbox/profile]
Market Segment: Metaverse / UGC Gaming / NFT Gaming
Sources: https://www.sandbox.game/; https://messari.io/asset/the-sandbox/profile

Competitor: Decentraland
Category: Metaverse / Virtual World (LAND, MANA token)
Difference: Decentraland metaverse virtual world browser-based di Ethereum, fokus social/experience bukan game loop kompetitif; Axie Infinity game-first dengan ekonomi token dual (AXS/SLP) + appchain (HIGH) [Decentraland Website, https://decentraland.org/; Messari Decentraland, https://messari.io/asset/decentraland/profile]
Market Segment: Metaverse / Virtual World
Sources: https://decentraland.org/; https://messari.io/asset/decentraland/profile

Competitor: Gala Games
Category: Blockchain Gaming Platform / Publisher (Multi-game, GalaChain)
Difference: Gala Games platform penerbit multi-game dengan GalaChain (appchain baru 2024); Axie Infinity single game franchise (Axie universe) dengan Ronin appchain matang sejak 2021 (HIGH) [Gala Games Website, https://gala.com/; GalaChain Docs, https://docs.galachain.com/; Messari Gala, https://messari.io/asset/gala/profile]
Market Segment: Blockchain Gaming Platform / Appchain
Sources: https://gala.com/; https://docs.galachain.com/; https://messari.io/asset/gala/profile

Competitor: Immutable X
Category: Gaming L2 (ZK-Rollup, Ethereum Scaling)
Difference: Immutable X L2 scaling solution untuk game (ZK-rollup), tidak mengembangkan game sendiri (publisher partner); Axie Infinity mengembangkan game sendiri + appchain Ronin (optimistic/sidechain, bukan ZK) (HIGH) [Immutable X Website, https://www.immutable.com/; Immutable X Docs, https://docs.immutable.com/; Messari Immutable, https://messari.io/asset/immutable/profile]
Market Segment: Gaming Infrastructure / L2 / Appchain
Sources: https://www.immutable.com/; https://docs.immutable.com/; https://messari.io/asset/immutable/profile

Competitor: Pixels
Category: Blockchain Gaming (Social Casual, Farming, Migration to Ronin)
Difference: Pixels game social casual farming migrasi ke Ronin 2023, memanfaatkan infrastruktur Ronin; Axie Infinity pengembang Ronin & game flagship (HIGH) [Pixels Website, https://www.pixels.xyz/; Ronin Ecosystem Pixels, https://roninchain.com/ecosystem; Axie Blog Welcome Pixels, https://axieinfinity.medium.com/welcome-pixels-to-ronin-]
Market Segment: Blockchain Gaming / Ronin Ecosystem Game
Sources: https://www.pixels.xyz/; https://roninchain.com/ecosystem; https://axieinfinity.medium.com/welcome-pixels-to-ronin-

Competitor: Big Time
Category: Blockchain Gaming (Action RPG, Multiplayer, Immutable X)
Difference: Big Time action RPG multiplayer di Immutable X, fokus cosmetic NFT & time-travel lore; Axie Infinity turn-based strategy dengan breeding genetics & land sim di Ronin (HIGH) [Big Time Website, https://bigtime.game/; Messari Big Time, https://messari.io/asset/big-time/profile]
Market Segment: Blockchain Gaming / Action RPG
Sources: https://bigtime.game/; https://messari.io/asset/big-time/profile

Competitor: Shrapnel
Category: Blockchain Gaming (FPS, AAA, Avalanche Subnet)
Difference: Shrapnel FPS AAA di Avalanche Subnet, fokus creator economy & extraction gameplay; Axie Infinity turn-based strategy 2D/2.5D di Ronin (HIGH) [Shrapnel Website, https://shrapnel.com/; Messari Shrapnel, https://messari.io/asset/shrapnel/profile]
Market Segment: Blockchain Gaming / FPS / AAA
